{"version":1,"key":"card:581","content":{"id":581,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"package.json 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolutions","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字段是 yarn 和 pnpm 包管理器提供的一个功能，用来强制指定依赖项的版本（包括嵌套依赖），减少依赖冲突问题。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见应用场景："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"覆盖依赖版本，比如 A 依赖 C@1.0.0，B 依赖 C@2.0.0，两个版本间存在冲突，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolutions","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定统一的版本"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"C\": \"2.0.0\" // 强制所有依赖的 C 都使用 2.0.0\n  }\n}","language":"JSON","uuid":"984712f9-bcea-46ff-9780-19c30fd2db01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决安全漏洞"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"嵌套依赖项存在安全问题，但是依赖项没有升级，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolutions","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 强制升级"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"lodash\": \"4.17.21\" // 强制使用安全的 lodash 版本\n  }\n}","language":"JSON","uuid":"4218138a-b5ab-451c-975f-f66ae71f91e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 冲突，多个依赖要求的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不同时，可以通过强制锁定版本覆盖依赖的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 版本"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// antd\n\"peerDependencies\": {\n  \"react\": \">=16.9.0\",\n  \"react-dom\": \">=16.9.0\"\n},","language":"JSON","uuid":"55f08803-6f83-4118-82a1-cc0c6013ff4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// react-codemirror2\n\"peerDependencies\": {\n  \"codemirror\": \"5.x\",\n  \"react\": \">=15.5 <=17.x\"\n},","language":"JSON","uuid":"46cdd406-b666-47f7-894a-6b70eef5f388","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述两个依赖的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 发生了冲突，那么可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolutions","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中指定一个版本解决依赖冲突问题"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"react\": \"18.2.0\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"18.2.0\"\n  }\n}","language":"JSON","uuid":"6804a0c8-8b03-44d0-b094-3994b524b9b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种方式的后果是可能存在不兼容，需要自行判断。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["面试题","包管理器/package.json"],"createTime":1745374412543,"updateTime":1746411062611,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1746411062611}}